\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\b\fs32 Markpad Native v2.0 — Quick Reference Card\cf0\b0\fs22\par
\cf2\b The VLC of Text Files — Published by Vodiy\cf0\b0\par
\par
\b Key Shortcuts:\b0\par
\f1 Ctrl + N\f0  : New Tab\par
\f1 Ctrl + O\f0  : Open File\par
\f1 Ctrl + S\f0  : Save Document\par
\f1 Ctrl + Shift + S\f0  : Save As...\par
\f1 Ctrl + E\f0  : Export (Standalone HTML / PDF / Clipboard)\par
\f1 Ctrl + F\f0  : Find & Replace\par
\f1 Ctrl + R\f0  : Recent Files\par
\par
\b Supported Formats:\b0\par
Markdown (.md, .markdown), JSON (.json), YAML (.yaml, .yml), TOML (.toml), XML (.xml), CSV (.csv), TSV (.tsv), Plain Text (.txt), Logs (.log), Configs (.env, .ini, .conf), SQL (.sql), Python (.py), Rust (.rs), JavaScript (.js), TypeScript (.ts), HTML (.html), SVG (.svg), CSS (.css), Excel (.xlsx, .xls), Word (.docx), PDF (.pdf).\par
\par
\b 100% Free & Open Source\b0\par
GitHub: https://github.com/shukurillo0526/Markpad\par
